LibreSpeed server on FenrirOS
=============================

Installed inert: the service is not enabled and there is no configuration.

    cp /usr/share/doc/librespeed-server/settings.toml.example /etc/librespeed/settings.toml
    $EDITOR /etc/librespeed/settings.toml
    dinitctl enable librespeed-server

It serves the speed test on port 8989 (listen_port). The statistics page
stays disabled until you set statistics_password; the example keeps results
in memory (database_type="memory"). Put it behind a reverse proxy for TLS
or set enable_tls and the certificate paths.
